# Independent adversarial language review (13 October 2026)

All 163 records and 378 examples were read. 159 records have no issue found by this independent model review; four records and the second personal retest remain blocked. This is not human native review. (13 October 2026)

## adv-causative (13 October 2026)
The stated godan a-row rule omits the u-ending exception. Applying it mechanically to 言う would produce 言あせる, while the primary curriculum explicitly gives 言わせる. All three stored examples are otherwise consistent. (13 October 2026)
Correction: State: Godan, change the final kana to the a-row, with う → わ, then add せる. Include 言う → 言わせる as a boundary example. (13 October 2026)
